The reification compiles and the previously failing mixed symbolic theorem now reaches `#Top`. Its equation is treated as the named trust boundary already documented by `MPY-FLOAT`: it is value-parametric, preserves the integer argument, and affects no control or state. I’m running all 27 unbounded sort combinations together now; afterward I’ll independently test the untouched LLVM semantics and perform the required mutation audits.
